      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AEROPLANE SWIFTY (3) failed to threaten on debut finishing seventh (23.21) at this track over 390m. Much improved and can open winning account. THERMAL FLASH (2) was well back throughout but attacked the line strongly to place, 7 lengths from the winner (22.83) at this track in Maiden. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Hard to beat again. STAGGER OUT CAS (8) is a newcomer from the Jack Strutt kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Can run a bold race on debut. Something for the Multiples: PALE GREEN STAR (10)",
